pub const NOTE : str = "Guard is check-user: an unknown telegram_id stops the run before any payment or paid API call. The step names generate-image-${i} and notify-image-${i} are templates the code expands once per requested image. Withdrawn from registerFunctions on 2026-09-17 (999-multibots-telegraf): no producer in the repo sends neuro/image.generate or neuro/photo.generate, the balance is charged before generation with no refund in onFailure, and processBalanceOperation carries no inv_id, so a retried step would charge twice. Code kept; re-register as reserve -> generate -> commit with inv_id = event.id and a real producer.";
